            <div><b>Block</b><p>When attacked, ${cr("click","tap")} your creature and then the attacker to block it, or take <b>Suggested blocks</b>. ${cr("Click","Tap")} a blocker twice to remove its block, or select it and ${cr("click","tap")} another attacker to move it. Confirm when done. With nothing able to block, the damage is taken for you.</p></div>
